{% doc %}
  Loads the LeadConnector (GoHighLevel) chat bubble on every page.

  Rendered from `snippets/scripts.liquid` rather than placed in the footer
  section group: section groups live in store-owned JSON that the theme editor
  writes, so a Git push cannot reliably add a section to them. Loading from a
  snippet keeps the widget deployable from this repo alone.

  LeadConnector styles and positions the bubble itself, so there is no markup
  or CSS here.
{% enddoc %}

<script
  src="https://widgets.leadconnectorhq.com/loader.js"
  data-resources-url="https://widgets.leadconnectorhq.com/chat-widget/loader.js"
  data-widget-id="6aae402650fc24ace62fca4f"
  defer
></script>
